        -: 1540:/// The completion_signature_of trait determines the completion signature
        -: 1541:/// of an asynchronous operation.
        -: 1542:/**
        -: 1543: * Class template @c completion_signature_of is a trait with a member type
        -: 1544: * alias @c type that denotes the completion signature of the asynchronous
        -: 1545: * operation initiated by the expression <tt>T(Args..., token)</tt> operation,
        -: 1546: * where @c token is an unspecified completion token type. If the asynchronous
        -: 1547: * operation does not have exactly one completion signature, the instantion of
        -: 1548: * the trait is well-formed but the member type alias @c type is omitted. If
        -: 1549: * the expression <tt>T(Args..., token)</tt> is not an asynchronous operation
        -: 1550: * then use of the trait is ill-formed.
        -: 1551: */
        -: 1552:template <typename T, typename... Args>
        -: 1553:struct completion_signature_of
        -: 1554:{
        -: 1555:  typedef automatically_determined type;
        -: 1556:};
        -: 1557:
        -: 1558:template <typename T, typename... Args>
        -: 1559:using completion_signature_of_t =
        -: 1560:  typename completion_signature_of<T, Args...>::type;
        -: 1561:
